                        <p>
                            Today's AI can generate text, images, and code with remarkable fluency. <strong>Engineering is different.</strong>
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            A mechanical part is not merely an image. It contains topology, dimensions, constraints, relationships, manufacturing intent, and physical structure.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            We are building systems that can reason about all of it.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="manifesto-callout">
                        &ldquo;A mechanical part is not merely an image. We are building systems that understand topology, constraints, relationships, and physical manufacturing intent.&rdquo;
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="progression-pipeline">
                    <div class="pipeline-card">
                        <span class="pipeline-step-num">01</span>
                        <div class="pipeline-title">Language</div>
                        <div class="pipeline-desc">Engineers express high-level requirements and intent[cite: 1].</div>
                        <span class="pipeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pipeline-card">
                        <span class="pipeline-step-num">02</span>
                        <div class="pipeline-title">Intent</div>
                        <div class="pipeline-desc">Decomposition into kinematic goals and structural objectives.</div>
                        <span class="pipeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pipeline-card">
                        <span class="pipeline-step-num">03</span>
                        <div class="pipeline-title">Constraints</div>
                        <div class="pipeline-desc">Geometric tolerances, assembly mates, and clearances.</div>
                        <span class="pipeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pipeline-card">
                        <span class="pipeline-step-num">04</span>
                        <div class="pipeline-title">Topology</div>
                        <div class="pipeline-desc">Continuous feature graphs and explicit mathematical connectivity.</div>
                        <span class="pipeline-arrow">&rarr;</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="pipeline-card">
                        <span class="pipeline-step-num">05</span>
